                            Preamble

  This License governs the installer wrapper and packaging of the
NumixCursorTheme-WindowsInstaller project. The purpose of this wrapper
is to simplify installation of the Numix cursor theme on Windows without
requiring additional dependencies. Because the cursor artwork is a
copyleft work under GPL-3.0, this License is designed to be compatible
with it while adding specific restrictions on the wrapper itself.

  The wrapper is provided free of charge and may be freely used and
shared. However, unlike the GPL, this License prohibits commercial
exploitation of the wrapper, in order to ensure it remains a free and
open utility for all users.

  The cursor files bundled herein remain the property of the Numix
Project and are governed exclusively by the GPL-3.0.

